  "prefLabel": "He-P 6002.06 Fees",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 6002.06 Fees.\n\n(a) The registration fees shall be as follows:\n\n(1) The initial registration fee shall be $100; and\n\n(2) The renewal registration fee shall be $100.\n\n(b) Registration fees shall be non-refundable pursuant to RSA 327-A:7.\n\nSource. #8593, eff 3-28-06; ss by #10453, eff 10-31-13",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-p6000.html"
